{{!
    @template mod_readaloud/studentreadingpassage

    Reading passage shown in a report, marked up with the student's errors.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * readreport - Read report data: thepassage (HTML)

    Example context (json):
    {
        "readreport": {
            "thepassage": "<p>Polar bears live in the <span class=\"mod_readaloud_grading_passageword\">Arctic</span>.</p>"
        }
    }
}}
<div class="mod_readaloud_studentreportpassage_cont mb-4 pt-md-4">
    <p class="h6 fw-semibold mb-4">{{#str}} readingpassage, mod_readaloud {{/str}}</p>
    <div class="mod_readaloud_studentreportpassage">
        {{{readreport.thepassage}}}
    </div>
</div>